    "it is narrower than prim_sync_reqack because it avoids a two-clock request/acknowledge FSM",
    "it avoids clock-gating special behavior and full IP-block breadth",
    "it should reuse the shared Verilator/GPU/runtime flow without target-specific runtime hooks"
  ],
